   544                              <1> ;
   545                              <1> ; Total stack usage for the #VC handler is 44 bytes:
   546                              <1> ;   - 12 bytes for the exception IRET (after popping error code)
   547                              <1> ;   - 32 bytes for the local variables.
   548                              <1> ;
   549                              <1> SevEsIdtVmmComm:
